@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-08 - Apply Coupon Code

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Cart UI" as FE
control "CouponsController" as API
control "CouponsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-08
FE -> API: GET /coupons/validate?code=&amount=
API -> Service: Execute Apply Coupon Code
Service -> DB: Read/write coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Discount được áp dụng (nếu coupon hợp lệ)

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Coupon không tồn tại -> Invalid code
  note over FE,Service: Coupon hết hạn -> Expired
  note over FE,Service: Amount < minOrderAmount -> Min order not met
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở trang cart hoặc checkout
Post: Discount được áp dụng (nếu coupon hợp lệ)
Main flow:
1. User nhập coupon code vào ô Promo Code
2. User bấm Apply
3. System gọi API GET /coupons/validate?code=X&amount=Y
4. System trả về { discountPercent, discountAmount, maxDiscount,\nfinalDiscount }
5. UI hiển thị số tiền giảm giá, tổng mới
end note
@enduml
